        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "57961d45-d1c1-5622-9070-a94e1e3d19ad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Walloon Legion, Wehrmacht, Waffen-SS\n- Places: Eastern Front, Northern Europe, Southern Europe, Central Europe, Eastern Europe\n- Events: Eastern Front of World War II\n- Topics: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- The Eastern Front of World War II was a theatre of conflict from 22 June 1941 to 9 May 1945.\n- The Eastern Front involved the European Axis powers and co-belligerent Finland fighting against the Soviet Union, Poland, and other Allies.\n- The Eastern Front encompassed Northern, Southern, Central, and Eastern Europe.\n- The Walloon Legion served on the Eastern Front in both front-line and reserve duties.\n- The Walloon Legion served first in the Wehrmacht and later in the Waffen-SS.",
